The sayings in `src/android/res/raw/quotes.txt` are not covered by the
licence above, because they are older than any licence.

    Book of Wise Sayings: Selected Largely from Eastern Sources
    Compiled by W. A. Clouston
    Hutchinson & Co., London, 1893

The book was published in 1893 and its compiler died in 1896, so both the
text and the compilation are in the public domain worldwide by age. The
transcription came from Project Gutenberg (ebook 21130); Project
Gutenberg's own header, footer and licence have been removed and its
trademark is not used, so nothing in this repository is subject to the
Project Gutenberg Licence. What remains is the public-domain text itself,
which anyone may use for any purpose.

